  "Id": 1815,
  "Title": "English for Security Guards",
  "NewsSubTitle": null,
  "NewsSummary": "English for Security Guards",
  "GlobalNews": false,
  "AlternateNewsTitle": null,
  "AlternateNewsSubtitle": null,
  "AlternateNewsSummary": null,
  "NewsContent": "<div class=\"ExternalClass6F7D74F1ACBC49F19431FB2C40FB015E\"><p>ELE_net is very happy to support staff training for the new AKUH Private Wing. We have recently completed an English course for AKU Security Guards assigned to work there. This was a consultancy course organized collaboratively with the Security Department and Human Resources.</p><p></p><p>The English for Security guards course ran for 10 weeks. The content was based on the common encounters a security guard is likely to have with the public in a typical working day at AKUH. The course prioritized the development of the participants' confidence and the use of polite language in common work-related situations.</p><p></p><p>The security guards worked really hard during the course and were eager to learn. Their enthusiasm and energy made the course a great success!</p></div>",
